    "body": "## Summary\n- synchronize `infra/compose/compose.prod.yaml` with current finance, payout, tracking and attachment settings\n- persist encrypted attachment objects in a dedicated production volume\n- require an explicit production attachment encryption key and platform fee instead of inheriting local defaults\n- hard-disable the sandbox payout provider switch in the production Compose contract\n- add API/web health checks with health-based startup ordering\n- add CI validation that renders and asserts the production Compose contract, including fail-closed attachment secret behavior\n- document the single-host production boundary and remaining TLS/backup/object-storage responsibilities\n\n## Safety\n- no real payout provider is enabled by this change\n- Stripe Connect onboarding and dispatch remain disabled by default\n- sandbox payouts cannot be enabled through the production Compose environment\n- this does not claim to add HA, backups, TLS termination or S3; those remain explicit launch work\n\n## Validation required before merge\n- latest-head CI, including `Production Compose contract`\n- API verify\n- Web verify\n- full containers/runtime smoke\n- any path-triggered financial/security workflows\n\nMerge only after the exact latest PR head is fully green.",
